[TOOL_CALLS]**Run query_graph function to get series IDs**

Please run the following function call to get the series IDs:

```json
{
  "name": "query_graph",
  "arguments": {
    "sparql": "SELECT (xmldb:series_id as series_id) WHERE { <http://brickschema.org/botsbuilding#DataCenter_bot_ZN_6> ref:hasExternalReference / ref:hasTimeseriesId series_id. }"
  }
}
```
